  "description": "Vintage Christmas village clipart filled with snowy houses, warmly lit bookshops and bakeries, a little chapel, decorated streets and nostalgic winter scenes. Christmas on Holly Lane brings together carol singers, ice skaters, a festive market, a child posting a letter to Santa and cozy village moments, alongside Christmas trees, wreaths, lanterns, a robin, a gift-filled sled and decorative winter elements. Rich reds, evergreen foliage and golden window light give the collection its storybook holiday charm. Use these individual illustrations for Christmas cards, invitations, gift tags, junk journals, scrapbook pages and seasonal craft projects.\nProduct details:\n– 50 Transparent PNG illustrations\n– High resolution: 2508 × 2508 pixels or 3072 × 2048 pixels, depending on the design\n– Preview mockup products and supporting backgrounds are not included.\nIf you enjoy this collection, please leave a review. Your feedback is appreciated.\nThank you!\nArtisticRevolutionⓒ",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Vintage Christmas village clipart filled with snowy houses, warmly lit bookshops and bakeries, a little chapel, decorated streets and nostalgic winter scenes. Christmas on Holly Lane brings together carol singers, ice skaters, a festive market, a child posting a letter to Santa and cozy village moments, alongside Christmas trees, wreaths, lanterns, a robin, a gift-filled sled and decorative winter elements. Rich reds, evergreen foliage and golden window light give the collection its storybook holiday charm. Use these individual illustrations for Christmas cards, invitations, gift tags, junk journals, scrapbook pages and seasonal craft projects.</p>\n<p>Product details:<br>\n– 50 Transparent PNG illustrations<br>\n– High resolution: 2508 × 2508 pixels or 3072 × 2048 pixels, depending on the design<br>\n– Preview mockup products and supporting backgrounds are not included.</p>\n<p>If you enjoy this collection, please leave a review. Your feedback is appreciated.</p>\n<p>Thank you!<br>\nArtisticRevolutionⓒ</p>",
